From c57bce3523c7c0ec23b67e23986699be96343131 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:31:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 43/58] topk: large-path hardening

- Inline-PTX acquire/release helpers declare their memory effects.
- The fault verdict is aggregated across the CTA group before emission, so a
  faulted row is failed closed by every CTA.
- 64-bit device counters and an int64 reader (counter protocol v2).
- Tests: adversarial distributions, slot-residue coverage, an sm_90 gate for
  tests that need it.
